00:00:15,003 --> 00:00:17,597
For me, personally,
this is an ideal combination.

5
00:00:17,663 --> 00:00:21,037
I've always loved deep space
exploration and the science behind it.

6
00:00:21,103 --> 00:00:25,057
So I get to work one-on-one with the science
teams to identify really what their

7
00:00:25,123 --> 00:00:28,277
science goal is and translate that for the
spacecraft team to something that we can

