9
00:00:32,503 --> 00:00:33,543
So,

10
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:41,093
one of the challenges that OSIRIS-REx has
been facing is the microgravity environment

11
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:43,393
that we are in when we orbit Bennu.

12
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:46,653
We don't have the strong pull
