affect our trajectory a lot more than

14
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:51,713
what we're used to.

15
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:54,693
So over the course of a few weeks,
we could end up on a number of different

16
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:59,373
trajectories, and that means our uncertainty
in planning and our responsibility to

17
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:01,813
