35
00:02:04,887 --> 00:02:09,340
So, our solar arrays are gimbaled so we can
continue to keep a power positive margin

36
00:02:09,407 --> 00:02:13,080
as we look at different sun angles and
different sites around the surface of the

37
00:02:13,147 --> 00:02:14,020
asteroid.

38
00:02:14,087 --> 00:02:18,100
Our thruster suites, we have very low
thrust engines that allow us to do very tiny

39
00:02:18,167 --> 00:02:21,160
