62
00:03:45,637 --> 00:03:50,270
When we got to Bennu, the rocky surface of
Bennu really changed our entire approach

63
00:03:50,337 --> 00:03:51,470
to TAG.

64
00:03:51,537 --> 00:03:56,230
Originally, we had expected to be able to
find a 25-meter radius site that could be

65
00:03:56,297 --> 00:04:00,550
safe to TAG in, that would be full of this
