66
00:04:00,617 --> 00:04:03,390
uneven surfaces that could be
dangerous for the spacecraft.

67
00:04:03,457 --> 00:04:04,230
Draft.

68
00:04:04,297 --> 00:04:07,750
Unfortunately, Benu did not know
